    31-. "<div>Calls with the injected<br />credential</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[HTTPS]</div>" .->34
    30-. "<div>Issues the enterprise<br />agent-access token presented<br />at</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[OAuth 2.0]</div>" .->31
    23-. "<div>Calls from inside an activity</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[HTTPS]</div>" .->35
    23-. "<div>Calls models from inside an<br />activity</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[HTTPS]</div>" .->36

